WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.660
Stop!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.100
Who is that girl?!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.480
I can't get out!

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.880
Damn it!

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.500
Eject your metal.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.270
The safety system is still active.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.740
I got it.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.520
Sylia!

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.980
Sylia!

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:17.970
Sylia, pull yourself together!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.910
Sotai...

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.380
Sotai?

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.120
Wait here.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.810
It's not a boomer.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.950
I hope Priss is all right.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.120
Who's there?!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.920
There's nobody in here, and nothing's left.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.030
Get lost!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.500
I can't believe I'm meeting
you in a place like this.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.270
Leon...

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.330
I wonder what the singing
princess is doing here?

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:30.240
Also, well, it's not my business
to say that it's cold in here...

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.650
Anyway, it isn't natural to be in a
place like this dressed like that.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.350
I thought it was impossible, but...

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.490
It's none of your business where I am!

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.230
The AD Police Center has announced

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:50.060
that the Knight Sabers are committing
some sabotage here.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.040
Sylia!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.310
Priss...

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.210
What are you going to do now?
Call your colleagues?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:10.190
You look like you're not alone,
don't you? Is anybody hurt?

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.650
It's none of your business, is it?

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.460
Orders are that the AD Police are
not to get involved in this.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.060
I'm here, but I'm not on duty.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.040
Leon...

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.950
The government announced today
that the abnormal shock occurring

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.250
under Tokyo was caused by the
collapse of an underground cavity

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.050
created during the earthquake.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:47.960
Concrete has been poured into the
space, so it won't happen again.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.420
Now, on to more news...

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.770
Sotai...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.000
I'm glad to see you again.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.910
Don't you remember me?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.920
It's sad to see you being called Sotai.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.350
You're not a golem. You're the true boomer.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.510
You need your own name.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.720
Galatea...

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.460
Yes, Galatea will suit you very well.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.150
May I call you that?

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:31.720
Stingray didn't want to make a simple golem.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:37.530
He wanted to create a new
species, beyond humankind.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.150
However, he changed sides.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.310
He sold not only his technology to
that old man, but his mind as well.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:49.610
But I'm different, Galatea.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:55.850
I want to dream. I have the power
to dream in the present.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:02.560
Give me that dream, Galatea.
Make the boomers awaken.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:08.170
Boomer?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.860
Mackey...

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.720
He's just sleeping now.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.330
He was awake a little while ago. Don't worry.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.160
How can you say things like that?!

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.840
Mackey is...

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:41.300
Mackey is not an ordinary boy.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:46.170
Whether he's ordinary or not, what
you think of him is up to you.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:50.710
For me, he's an excellent assistant,

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.410
and he's not a boomer.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.150
You know that very well, don't you?

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.090
But Mackey is...

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.490
Not a human being either.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.960
I'm sorry.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.130
I'm sorry to make you worry about me.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.530
I was told not to go there,

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.670
but I couldn't control myself.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.240
Who is that girl who was called Sotai?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.870
She's the same as I am. We're Sylia's
younger brother and sister.

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:39.500
More accurately, you are part of
Sylia's body, separated from her.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.260
In the Wiz Lab, we called them dopplegangers.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.100
Clones?

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.440
No, that's not it.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:54.880
When Sylia was young, her father
implanted a mechanism within her.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:59.620
It had been copied by synapse
conduction from a human brain,

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.050
and it integrated itself into Sylia's brain.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.780
It didn't happen in anybody else.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.860
Only Sylia's body did not reject
the nano-mechanism.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.400
Of course not!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:19.930
It was created by copying her
mother's Corpus Pineale.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:25.410
What? A father... a human
shouldn't do things like that.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.880
However, that is what allowed my birth,

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.850
even though I am a doppleganger.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.880
Even though I don't grow and am
not exactly a human being.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:41.590
Anyway, the one born earlier was the Sotai.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.960
She is the archetype of all current boomers.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.190
Mackey was too close to a human being.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.630
That's why he was abandoned.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:56.430
I can't believe she's alive. I thought
the earthquake buried her.

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:58.410
Why?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:02.450
How horrible! How many people
died in that earthquake?!

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:04.580
If all the others were anything like her,

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.850
causing the earthquake was by
far the lesser of two evils.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.730
Both number four and number five
barriers have been breached!

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.760
Main control is... What the hell is this?!

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:38.510
The Sotai is about to go up to the surface!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:48.090
We have to stop it! If this phenomenon
affects the outside,

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.620
humans will be finished!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.720
Oh no, we can't stop it!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.420
What is this light?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.550
What the hell is going on?

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:46.010
What the hell is happening in the Wiz Lab?!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.720
What the hell did Stingray do?!

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:53.160
He was not able to control
the Sotai Phenomenon.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.250
I should say he didn't have the talent to do so.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.460
I don't want to hear criticism.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.900
What are you going to do?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.460
What shall we do?

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.100
The only thing we can do is to
seal it with the whole Wiz Lab.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.470
How?

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:13.640
The earthquake weapon developed
by Genom's military division

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.670
has been completed, hasn't it?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.640
There is no other way, is there?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.810
The person who needs to decide
that is you, Mr. Chairman.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.340
Come with me.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:11:01.520
You should have stayed in
your room, you bad girl.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.680
Get in.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.350
Please, please go inside.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:38.260
I wanted to be with you until you
are old enough to understand me.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.460
This is some kind of mistake!
I haven't created you to...

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.330
to let you do things like this!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.100
The phenomenon's existence
had not been revealed

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:21.070
to lower class technical people like me.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:25.170
I'm the only one still alive who
served at the Wiz Lab.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.380
Nene...

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:31.680
You understand why Sylia hates
out of control boomers, don't you?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.680
I went out of control too.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.960
That was fun. It was just a short while,

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:45.020
but I was able to be with Priss,
Linna, and you, Nene.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.300
What are you talking about?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:50.000
I shouldn't have come here,

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.100
but I really wanted to see her.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.840
I believed that I wanted to
come here to see Sylia.

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:59.300
I was wrong. The other one was
what lead me to come here.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.910
Because she wanted to get out of there.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.520
I shouldn't exist anywhere, should I?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.950
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.820
There isn't a person...

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:18.320
There isn't a person anywhere
who shouldn't exist.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.630
Person...

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:24.190
Mackey is Mackey!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.700
Nene...

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.950
You aren't going to see Sylia, are you?

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.860
I guess Nene went to see Mackey.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.330
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.630
None of my business.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.970
Why are you worrying about things like that?

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:04.210
Is Sylia your friend? Is Nene
your younger sister?

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.910
We were simply people who
worked together. That's it.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.470
We were?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.850
We're through, aren't we?

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:23.390
Through? Do you mean you're
quitting the Knight Sabers?!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.550
Are you saying you won't wear
your hard suit anymore?

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.600
Hard suit?!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.800
Do you really think we'll be able
to put them on or something?!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:35.200
Well, those aren't wearable anymore, but...

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.940
I'm sure Nigel will make new ones.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.410
I won't wear one ever again.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.080
Why?

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.220
I've been thinking for a long time.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:50.450
Why did our hard suits stop, and
why did we lose control that time?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:56.560
It happened after the Sotai appeared.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.860
The first ones to go out of control
were the boomers.

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:03.800
Then after that, our hard suits went out.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.700
Those bastards from Genom,

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.030
real human beings were the only
ones not being affected at all.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:16.670
The ones that went out of
control were boomers!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:23.190
Wait a second. You mean... You
mean our hard suits are...

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.650
They're boomers.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.420
It can't be!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.620
Both Nigel and Mackey have known about it.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.560
Only we didn't know the facts.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:39.020
I see. I didn't think our hard suits
were ordinary powered armor.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.370
However, if they're boomers, they
have to have a core in them.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.940
Where is it?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.810
It's got to be buried somewhere.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.500
I understand now.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.180
Did you come here to arrest us?

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.680
Currently, I'm off duty.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.650
I came here just because there
might be a live show tonight.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.120
Eavesdropping is the lowest thing you could do.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.850
You weren't exactly whispering, either of you.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.500
Priss, who is this man?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.430
A frontline officer of the AD Police.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.940
You're the other one!

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:17.930
Your suit looks good. I remember
your body line very well.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.280
You jerk!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.180
Priss!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.550
It can't all be over! I won't accept this!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:34.580
It's... How can I say it? It's not good that...

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:43.930
Shall we ride?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.080
You didn't tell anyone about
the other day, did you?

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:02.150
At the tunnel? I told you that I
shouldn't have been there.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:05.020
There's no way that I'd be able to report you.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.060
I thought you hated the Knight Sabers?

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:13.260
You're right, because they
were making fools of us.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:19.470
Can I ask you the same question?
Why do you hate the AD Police?

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.870
No reason really,

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:24.710
but I get sick just looking at the
outfit of the frontline officers.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:29.140
I don't really understand, but I
apologize anyway. Sorry.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.750
Your apologizing doesn't help.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.840
Then please don't be so hard on me.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.490
You know, I'm the kind of man

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.250
you don't understand unless you
have a deep relationship with me.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:44.960
Idiot.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.010
Your team is going to break up, isn't it?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.870
Oh, sorry, that's too personal.

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:06.620
Anyway, it's too bad, isn't it?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.890
We lose our rival, and it's hard to
stay enthused about our work.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:14.550
It's about time. The government,
the AD Police, Genom,

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:16.530
everyone tries to hide the facts,

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.360
but people have begun to realize
that boomers can become insane.

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:22.200
The number of mad boomers
is increasing rapidly,

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:26.430
so it's impossible to deal with them by ourselves.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:32.240
In my company, we call it the
AD Police in the outside world,

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:35.230
something is disturbing the top management.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.480
The director seems like he's hiding something.

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.040
Sotai is in there.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.180
Sotai?

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.580
I don't have anything to do with it anymore.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.090
Well...

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.360
This area is a no parking zone.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.300
Violation of traffic regulations, section 241...

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:58.530
You jerk! Don't disturb our date!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:04.610
Go away! Get the hell out of here! Idiot!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.170
I'm so sorry, Officer Leon!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:13.050
That was an abuse of your authority, wasn't it?

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.020
How beautiful your eyes are.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.560
Why can't I put things in a nicer way?

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:26.030
That might be the reason I'm not
good at dealing with women.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.160
Hey, what's the matter?

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.630
What's wrong with you?! Priss!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.110
What's wrong with you two?!

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:27.750
What is this?

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.260
Sylia...

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.270
What is this? Why am I seeing things like this?

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.710
Sylia?!

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.740
Sylia!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.670
No, stop this!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.420
I'm so scared.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.110
Next Episode

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:05.120
The mysterious vision which
suddenly appeared in our minds

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.910
doesn't make any sense.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.080
But unbelievably, it was Sylia's secret memory.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.500
We rush to Sylia's place

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.880
and find she is suffering from
a resonance with the Sotai.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:19.260
Then Sylia tells us another story
of the Knight Sabers' past.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.130
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
